<div class="nc-hto-page">

  <div class="nc-hto-hero">
    <span class="nc-hto-tag">Guide</span>
    <h1>How to Order</h1>
    <p>Follow these simple steps to place your order on Nichey.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="nc-hto-wrap">

    <div class="nc-hto-steps">

      <div class="nc-hto-step">
        <div class="nc-hto-num">1</div>
        <div class="nc-hto-content">
          <h3>Browse & Discover</h3>
          <p>Explore our curated collections using the menu or search bar. Filter by category, brand, or skin concern to find exactly what you need.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="nc-hto-step">
        <div class="nc-hto-num">2</div>
        <div class="nc-hto-content">
          <h3>Add to Cart</h3>
          <p>Found something you love? Select your preferred size or variant and click "Add to Cart". You can continue shopping and add as many items as you like.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="nc-hto-step">
        <div class="nc-hto-num">3</div>
        <div class="nc-hto-content">
          <h3>Review Your Cart</h3>
          <p>Click the cart icon to review your selected items. You can update quantities, remove items, or apply a promo code before proceeding.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="nc-hto-step">
        <div class="nc-hto-num">4</div>
        <div class="nc-hto-content">
          <h3>Checkout</h3>
          <p>Click "Checkout" and enter your shipping address and contact details. All information is secured with SSL encryption.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="nc-hto-step">
        <div class="nc-hto-num">5</div>
        <div class="nc-hto-content">
          <h3>Choose Shipping</h3>
          <p>Select your preferred shipping method — Standard (3–5 business days) or Express (1–2 business days). Free shipping on orders over AED 400.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="nc-hto-step">
        <div class="nc-hto-num">6</div>
        <div class="nc-hto-content">
          <h3>Payment</h3>
          <p>We accept Visa, Mastercard, American Express, PayPal, Apple Pay, and Google Pay. Choose your method and complete your payment securely.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="nc-hto-step">
        <div class="nc-hto-num">7</div>
        <div class="nc-hto-content">
          <h3>Order Confirmation</h3>
          <p>Once your order is placed, you'll receive a confirmation email with your order details. Keep it for your records.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="nc-hto-step">
        <div class="nc-hto-num">8</div>
        <div class="nc-hto-content">
          <h3>Track Your Order</h3>
          <p>After dispatch, you'll receive a shipping confirmation with a tracking number so you can follow your delivery in real time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="nc-hto-cta">
    <div class="nc-hto-cta-inner">
      <div class="nc-hto-cta-icon">🛍️</div>
      <h3>Ready to shop?</h3>
      <p>Discover our full range of premium beauty and skincare products.</p>
      <a href="/collections/all" class="nc-hto-btn">Shop Now</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<style>
.nc-hto-page { font-family: inherit; color: #1a1a1a; background: #fff; }
.nc-hto-hero { text-align: center; padding: 80px 20px 60px; background: #fafafa; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; }
.nc-hto-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #888; margin-bottom: 16px; padding: 6px 14px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 20px; }
.nc-hto-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px); font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 0 0 16px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
.nc-hto-hero p { font-size: 16px; color: #777; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 500px; }
.nc-hto-wrap { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 20px; }
.nc-hto-steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
.nc-hto-step { display: flex; gap: 28px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 32px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #efefef; }
.nc-hto-step:first-child { border-top: 1px solid #efefef; }
.nc-hto-num { width: 44px; height: 44px; min-width: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: #1a1a1a; color: #fff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.nc-hto-content h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 0 0 8px; padding-top: 10px; }
.nc-hto-content p { font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; }
.nc-hto-cta { background: #f7f4f0; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center; }
.nc-hto-cta-inner { max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; }
.nc-hto-cta-icon { font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.nc-hto-cta h3 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 0 0 12px; }
.nc-hto-cta p { font-size: 15px; color: #777; margin: 0 0 28px; line-height: 1.6; }
.nc-hto-btn { display: inline-block; padding: 13px 36px; background: #1a1a1a; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; transition: background 0.2s; }
.nc-hto-btn:hover { background: #333; }
@media(max-width: 768px) {
  .nc-hto-hero { padding: 60px 20px 40px; }
  .nc-hto-wrap { padding: 40px 16px; }
  .nc-hto-step { gap: 16px; padding: 24px 0; }
  .nc-hto-num { width: 36px; height: 36px; min-width: 36px; font-size: 14px; }
  .nc-hto-cta { padding: 60px 20px; }
}
</style>

